# Cost Trend API Endpoints

### GET /api/cost/trend - Get cost trend (last 30 days)
GET {{base_url}}/api/cost/trend

> {%
  client.test("Cost trend returns 200", function() {
    expect(response.status).to.equal(200);
  });
  
  client.test("Response is an array", function() {
    var body = JSON.parse(response.body);
    expect(body).to.be.an("array");
  });
